1
00:00:00,420 --> 00:00:02,950
(Leonard:)Yeah, thanks,
but nobody asked you.

2
00:00:02,956 --> 00:00:06,126
(Theodore:)Well, I'm just gonna
keep on talking.

3
00:00:06,994 --> 00:00:08,264
(Theodore:)Seems like, with Sheldon

4
00:00:08,261 --> 00:00:13,161
(Theodore:)moving out, you're
in a new phase of your lives

5
00:00:13,166 --> 00:00:14,666
(Theodore:)and it's easier

6
00:00:14,668 --> 00:00:17,668
(Theodore:)to fight than
to face the feelings

7
00:00:17,671 --> 00:00:20,571
(Theodore:)that you have for one another.

8
00:00:21,975 --> 00:00:24,375
(Amy:)I think he might be right.

9
00:00:24,378 --> 00:00:26,348
(Amy:)Also, who is that?

10
00:00:27,547 --> 00:00:30,417
(Sheldon:)I have to admit,

11
00:00:30,417 --> 00:00:32,047
(Sheldon:)leaving you to
move in with Amy

12
00:00:32,052 --> 00:00:34,482
(Sheldon:)has been harder than
I thought it would be.

13
00:00:34,488 --> 00:00:36,118
(Leonard:)Well, for me, too.

14
00:00:36,123 --> 00:00:38,053
(Leonard:)It's not the same
with you gone.

15
00:00:38,058 --> 00:00:39,758
(Theodore:)If you're looking for a new guy
to live with...

16
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:41,530
-No!
- We're good. Thank you.

17
00:00:42,829 --> 00:00:45,499
(Amy:)So, no one's gonna
tell me? Okay.

18
00:00:45,499 --> 00:00:46,829
(Sheldon:)Leonard,

19
00:00:46,833 --> 00:00:48,233
(Sheldon:)I would like us
to stop fighting

20
00:00:48,235 --> 00:00:49,605
(Sheldon:)about our possessions.

21
00:00:49,603 --> 00:00:51,233
(Leonard:)Well, I'd like that, too.

22
00:00:51,238 --> 00:00:54,568
(Sheldon:)In fact, I want you to
keep the apartment flag,

23
00:00:54,574 --> 00:00:55,874
(Sheldon:)and I'm not
just saying that

24
00:00:55,876 --> 00:00:58,406
(Sheldon:)because it touched
your genitals.

